# What Vercel needs from this repository is the Express app, its entry point and
# public/. Everything else here belongs to the Windows recorder, and uploading
# it makes every deploy slower for nothing — the Rust tree and the benchmark
# CSVs are the bulk of what is checked in.
#
# Mirrors .dockerignore, minus the entries that would take the web app with it.

.git
node_modules

# The recorder: a Windows desktop app, none of which runs on Linux.
recorder-app
recorder-core
recorder-proto
target
Cargo.toml
Cargo.lock
.cargo

# Benchmark data: hundreds of MB of frame CSVs.
bench

# Design comps and prose — read on GitHub, not served.
design
docs
*.md

# Local review data and secrets, should either exist on the machine deploying.
data
.env
.env.local

*.log
*.zip
*.mp4
